==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/swɒt/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/swɔt/}}, /swŏt/
* {{audio|en-us-swat.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|ɒt}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|swat|t|ing}}

# {{transitive}} To [[beat]] [[off]], as insects; to [[bat]], [[strike]], or [[hit]].
#: ''He '''swatted''' the mosquito that was buzzing around in his bedroom.''
#: ''The cat '''swatted''' at the feather.''

====Translations====
{{trans-top|to beat off, as insects; to bat, strike, or hit}}
