* French: {{t+|fr|frapper}}
{{trans-mid}}
* Italian: {{t+|it|schiacciare}}
* Russian: {{t+|ru|прихлопнуть}}
{{trans-bottom}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A hard [[stroke]], [[hit]] or [[blow]], e.g., as part of a [[spanking]].
# {{rfv-sense}} The exchange, in turns, of swats, usually with a paddle and to the buttocks, either as a macho dare or imposed as a 'self-inflicted' corporal punishment or as part of a fraternity-type [[hazing]].

====Translations====
